{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14226770","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14226770","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1422677001:1":{"text":"旅を重ね、それなりに見聞を広めたつもりでいましたが、こんな場所は初めてです……","source_cn":"我本以为游历四方后已经见识匪浅了。但从没见过萨洛克兰这...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35732A3DCA8A25C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1422677002:1":{"text":"ユグドラシルの建築スタイルとは全然違いますね。どちらかと言えば、ブライト寄りでしょうか……","source_cn":"这里的建筑风格和薄暮丛林完全不一样，倒是有一些耀光的感觉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x28AEDDE080A96C59","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1422677003:1":{"text":"私たちの住居は、木々と共生し、自然に寄り添って作られるので、サロクディアのような壮観な見た目とはほど遠い。","source_cn":"我们的居所都是与树木共生，随自然而建，并不像萨洛克兰这...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA604E9BB80BFFE41","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1422677004:1":{"text":"恐らく、ドワーフの協力で建てられたからだろう。","source_cn":"萨洛克兰是由矮人一族协助建造的，可能这是原因之一吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x02FE9D9664DF1519","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1422677005:1":{"text":"壮観な外見も……一種の秩序と境界の現れだと私は思っている。","source_cn":"至于壮观……或许这也是一种秩序和界限的体现。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x97685A5D1019961B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1422677006:1":{"text":"秩序と境界ですか？面白いですね。ユグドラシルでは、秩序は自然そのものであり、人為的に決められるものではありませんから。","source_cn":"秩序和界限吗？有趣的说法。在薄暮丛林，我们的秩序是自然...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7FE79DC4CA76FC91","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1422677007:1":{"text":"それにしても、昔の状況を聞いたあとに、こうして今のサロクディアを見ると……","source_cn":"不过，看到萨洛克兰现在的变化，再对比你们之前描述的情况。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x164BBAB0030BBBAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1422677008:1":{"text":"できることなら、あなた方のことをもっと深く知りたいと思いました……","source_cn":"我只是有一些遗憾，不能再更深入地了解你们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB4338EFA858CF4AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1422677009:1":{"text":"今回は試練で戻ってきたからな……王都をゆっくり見せてやれないのが残念だが。","source_cn":"这次考验在身上，不能带你好好浏览萨洛克兰。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA53BAA82A13818F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1422677010:1":{"text":"もし、呪いが解けたら……その時はぜひ、私の故郷を案内させてくれ。","source_cn":"如果……诅咒真能解除，我一定会带着你好好看看我的家乡。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21E0547AE3661CDA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_ma